    "title": "Bayside wrestling tourney on Monday",
    "date": "2024-02-17",
    "author": "Bill Haufe",
    "content": "Bayside wrestling tourney on Monday\n\n February 17, 2024 | Star Democrat, The (Easton, MD)\n\n Author/Byline: Bill Haufe | Section: News \n \n 56\n Words \n\n Read News Document\n\n BERLIN — The Bayside Conference wrestling championships have been rescheduled for Monday, Feb. 19, at Stephen Decatur High School.The annual tournament, which was scheduled for Saturday, was postponed Friday because of inclement weather forecasted for the area.\nWrestling is slated to start at 10 a.m. Monday, with the championship finals scheduled to begin around 5 p.m. \n\n © Copyright © 2024 Star Democrat, Chesapeake Publishing Group (Adams Publishing/APGMedia). All rights reserved.",
