0: Ryder (HVT) d. Travers (WIC) by fft.; 215: Morris (NC) d. Pritchett (NE), 7-6; 285: Johnson (RS) d. Pickrom (CR), 8-4. \n\n © Copyright © 2024 Star Democrat, Chesapeake Publishing Group (Adams Publishing/APGMedia). All rights reserved.",
