    "content": "Smith shines in Herons' opener\n\n March 20, 2024 | Star Democrat, The (Easton, MD)\n\n Author/Byline: Bill Haufe | Section: News \n \n 48\n Words \n\n Read News Document\n\n NORTH EAST — Ethan Harper scored a pair of goals and goalie Jonah Smith made 25 saves Wednesday, as Gunston School's boys lacrosse team opened its season with a 7-5 loss at Tome School.Jack Beasley, Rowan Larkin and Ben Simon each scored one goal apiece for Gunston. \n\n © Copyright © 2024 Star Democrat, Chesapeake Publishing Group (Adams Publishing/APGMedia). All rights reserved.",
