    "title": "Davis' grand slam leads N. Caroline",
    "date": "2024-03-21",
    "author": "Bill Haufe",
    "content": "Davis' grand slam leads N. Caroline\n\n March 21, 2024 | Star Democrat, The (Easton, MD)\n\n Author/Byline: Bill Haufe | Section: News \n \n 68\n Words \n\n Read News Document\n\n RIDGELY — Will Davis hit a grand slam and Owen Caraballo drove in three runs Thursday as North Caroline High's baseball team routed Woodbridge (Del.) 12-1 in five innings in Vincent Manetti's debut as Bulldogs head coach.Ethan Poore earned the win, yielding one earned run and four hits over five innings. Poore had three strikeouts and walked five. Caden Deavers knocked in two runs for North Caroline. \n\n © Copyright © 2024 Star Democrat, Chesapeake Publishing Group (Adams Publishing/APGMedia). All rights reserved.",
    "year": 2024,
    "month": 3,
    "day": 21,
    "metadata_sport": "baseball",
    "metadata_story_type": "game recap",
    "metadata_location": "Ridgely, Maryland",
    "metadata_teams": "[\"North Caroline High\", \"Woodbridge\"]",
